  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EQUIPPING TWO TEACHING HOSPITALS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT IMPROVING THE HEALTH CARE DELIVERY SYSTE M BY UPGRADING THE EXISTING FACILITIES AND BY PROVIDING MODERN MEDICAL EQUIPMENT FOR TWO TEACHING HOSPITALS. WHEN COMPLETED THE PROJECT WILL ENABLE THE TWO HOSPITALS TO OFFER BETTER DIAGNOSTIC AND HENCE BETTER THERAPEUTIC TREATMENT THUS REDUCING THE WAITING TIME FOR PATIENTS. ALSO, THE PROJECT WILL PROVIDE TRAINING FOR MEDICAL DOCTORS.</narrative>
  </description>
